Not covered by this license:

  reference/lenovo-vcp-codes.json

That file is `VCPCodeDef.json`, a data file authored and distributed by Lenovo
as part of Lenovo Display Control Center ("Artery"). It is reproduced here
unmodified, for reference, because it documents the manufacturer-reserved VCP
codes of Lenovo monitors and is otherwise hard to find. All rights to it remain
with Lenovo. If you would rather not rely on a redistributed copy, the same file
ships with any Artery installation under

  C:\Program Files (x86)\Lenovo\LenovoDisplayControlCenterService\
